---
const cards = [
  { title: 'Derive execution', body: 'Green Tea topologically sorts the graph. Stop maintaining execution order by hand.' },
  {
    title: 'Fail before traffic',
    body: 'A missing dependency or an ambiguous route fails loudly at boot, not in production.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Real validation',
    body: 'Standard Schema; bring zod, valibot, or arktype. No validator dependency in core.',
  },
  {
    title: 'See what was derived',
    body: 'Print the ordered pipeline, open the live graph, project the same metadata into OpenAPI 3.1.',
  },
  { title: 'Secure by default', body: 'Hardened response headers and CORS; native TLS on Node.' },
  {
    title: 'A small foundation',
    body: 'reflect-metadata is the only runtime dependency; ws and busboy are optional peers for sockets and uploads.',
  },
];
---

<section class="batteries">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="batteries__head">
      <p class="kicker">Foundation ownership</p>
      <h2>We maintain the foundation. You maintain the product.</h2>
      <p class="batteries__lede">
        Routing, graph execution, validation integration, streaming, security defaults, errors, OpenAPI, lifecycle,
        runtime adapters — the framework work your application would otherwise assemble and then keep working. The
        goal isn't fewer dependencies for a badge; it's fewer moving parts your team has to understand, upgrade and
        debug.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="batteries__grid">
      {
        cards.map((card) => (
          <li class="batteries__card">
            <h3>{card.title}</h3>
            <p>{card.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .batteries__head {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .batteries__head h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .batteries__lede {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    max-width: 46rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .batteries__grid {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .batteries__card {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dim) 18%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .batteries__card h3 {
    color: var(--matcha);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  }

  .batteries__card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .batteries__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .batteries__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
